i'm not sure i understand. Above i thought the idea was that home assistant requests were causing the issue? The instructions above for debug logging will show all home assistant commands. Even if its not causing the issue, the home assistant commands should still be visible in the full raw log when debug mode is enabled.

Hi, sorry i wasnt clear. The HA requests (ie polling for status) seem to be causing the issue. What im flagging is that no explicit request from HA is made to stop the active cycle, but it stops. Ill enable debig and get some logs

